Cell["\<\
Un tipo de recinto m\[AAcute]s complejo ser\[IAcute]a el tri\[AAcute]ngulo de \
v\[EAcute]rtices (0,0), (1,0), (0,1). En este caso, podemos considerar una \
cualquiera de las variables, por ejemplo la x. La variable x se mueve entre 0 \
y 1. Una vez fijado el valor de x, entre 0 y 1. El valor de y se mover\
\[AAcute] entre 0 y 1-x. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7240802188314285`*^9, 
  3.724080340012229*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9bdef31d-ab5e-47be-adcf-\
759c54e3f247"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Show", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"RegionPlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", "x", "\[LessEqual]", "1"}], "&&", 
      RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", "y", "\[LessEqual]", 
       RowBox[{"1", "-", "x"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"y", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"ParametricPlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0.4", ",", 
       RowBox[{"0.6", "t"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.720759466488262*^9, 3.7207595183602295`*^9}, {
  3.7207595854090643`*^9, 3.7207595915284147`*^9}, {3.720760409554203*^9, 
