Cell["\<\
Quiz\[AAcute]s la forma m\[AAcute]s sencilla ser\[IAcute]a considerar la \
integral en el medio disco grande y restarle la integral en el medio disco \
peque\[NTilde]o. Dado que la funci\[OAcute]n f(x,y)=xy est\[AAcute] definida \
en todo el plano, esto se podr\[IAcute]a hacer.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.724081426957836*^9, 3.724081443166236*^9}, {
  3.724081734979838*^9, 3.724081747537838*^9}, {3.7240821135918407`*^9, 
  3.7240821932610407`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"219be8c7-15cb-42c8-ba47-\
4ef2bf9679b2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"RegionPlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "+", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"y", "-", "3"}], ")"}], "2"]}], "\[LessEqual]", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["2", "2"]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"y", ",", "1", ",", "5"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"RegionPlot", "[", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "+", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"y", "-", "3"}], ")"}], "2"]}], "\[LessEqual]", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["1", "2"]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"y", ",", "1", ",", "5"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  "}"}]], "Input",
